{'symbol': 'PCG', 'date': '2023-02-01 10:16:00', 'title': 'BUYING OR LEASING A PRE-OWNED ELECTRIC VEHICLE? PG&E ELECTRIC CUSTOMERS CAN APPLY FOR NEW REBATE OF UP TO $4,000', 'text': 'MORE THAN $78 MILLION AVAILABLE THROUGH THE PRE-OWNED EV REBATE PROGRAM TO MAKE EV OWNERSHIP MORE AFFORDABLE FOR ALL CUSTOMERS \xa0\xa0 OAKLAND, CALIF. , FEB. 1, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- PACIFIC GAS AND ELECTRIC COMPANY (PG&E) TODAY ANNOUNCED THE LAUNCH OF ITS PRE-OWNED ELECTRIC VEHICLE (EV) REBATE PROGRAM, PROVIDING QUALIFIED RESIDENTIAL CUSTOMERS UP TO $4,000 WHEN PURCHASING OR LEASING A PRE-OWNED EV.'}